hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"343","A chapter on settling offspring on the coasts and frontiers: Umar ibn Uthman narrated to us, he said: Al-Walid ibn Muslim recited it to us, from al-Wadin ibn Ata', from Makhul and al-Qasim Abu Abd al-Rahman, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Do not leave offspring facing the enemy."
